 * pi-claude-conversion with deferLoading:true. If tool_search cataloged them, a
 * "select:WebFetch" hit could activate them as standard function tools instead
 * of letting the bridge intercept them natively — corrupting the provider
 * request. They ride along in tools[] as zero-cost defer stubs; tool-search
 * neither indexes nor eagerly activates them.
